WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
<c.white>The tide comes in at noon.</c>

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
<c.lime>Bring the rope.</c>

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<c.cyan>The boat is ready.</c>

4
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<c.red>Mind the step!</c>

5
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<c.yellow>(engine starts)</c>

6
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
<c.magenta>Hold on tight.</c>

7
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<c.blue>We are off.</c>

8
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<c.black>Quiet now.</c>

9
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<c.bg_black.yellow>[radio static]</c>

10
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<c.loud>Land ahead!</c> <c.yellow.loud>Look!</c>
